                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a heinous manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2568433a-d83a-498f-a4bd-62d7abc2b1ba",
                                                "sense_id": "dbbc3ccc-7cee-37bb-8fa1-91852b0da2f9",
                                                "text": "At length the ministering mutual friend obtained the consent of the Angersteins that Duval should offer, in person, the best and sincerest proofs of his self-abhorrence, of his repentance, and of his unspeakable admiration of the character and conduct of her whom he had so heinously distressed, and unmanlily assailed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
